  "name": "Oven-Baked Caramel French Toast",
  "subtitle": "An overnight breakfast bake with a buttery caramel base and pecans.",
  "description": "Bread soaks in a cinnamon-spiced custard overnight, then bakes over a caramel-pecan layer until lightly browned and set.",
